# wrangler — local Worker secrets and local DO/R2/KV state.
# .dev.vars holds APP_PASSWORD for `wrangler dev`; .wrangler/ holds the local
# Durable Object SQLite and R2 blobs, i.e. real note content once the Worker is
# run locally. Same two lines apps/notion-web already has.
.dev.vars
.wrangler
